    description: "On all 84 AnalysisRuns, the three parallel 'what didn't go right this pass' fields use two container types: files_skipped=0 (int) while failed_files=[] and warnings=[] (lists). A consumer iterating the per-pass problem channels must special-case files_skipped. Fix: harmonize the AR what-went-wrong field container types (e.g. make files_skipped a list, or document the intentional asymmetry). Distinct from INV-buhur (satisfied: failed_files never populated) — different mechanism. Surfaced via dogfooding; blinded severity 2/5."  # a7e2
